e where void functions returning hard typed function calls were not raising errors as expected.\r\n#\r\nExample as given in the issue report:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc getRand1() -> void:\r\n    return randf() # No errors were raised.\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf you assigned the function to a variable and then returned the variable, it noticed the error:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc getRand2() -> void:\r\n    var rand: float = randf()\r\n    return rand # Parser Error: A void function cannot return a value.\r\n```\r\nI've tested my changes by repeating the examples above, and further testing different cases myself. It should work as intended now.\r\n#\r\nThe current unit tests seem to pass, but I'd appreciate confirmation on the way they're intended to be done as I'm unsure.\r\n\r\nFixes #108175","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"ht